1. Updated the `availability` array to have a proper structure with time slots. Instead of `[[]]`, it now contains actual availability data with days and time ranges.
2. Added proper `workingHours` data structure with time slots.
3. Added proper `schedule` data structure with time slots.

The error was occurring because the Schedule component expects the availability data to have a specific structure, and an empty nested array (`[[]]`) wasn't sufficient. The new structure provides:
- Days of the week (0-4 representing Monday to Friday)
- Start time and end time for each availability slot
- Proper nesting of the availability array

This should resolve the "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'length')" error as the component now has proper data structures to work with.

