Key changes made:

1. Changed the availability structure to be a 7-element array (one for each day of the week)
2. Each day's availability is now an array of time ranges
3. Each time range has `start` and `end` as Date objects
4. Added proper form context with defaultValues for both schedule and availability
5. Made sure the availability array matches the expected structure where index 0 is Sunday, 1 is Monday, etc.
6. Empty arrays for days with no availability (Sunday and Saturday)
7. Proper Date objects for all time values

The error was occurring because the Schedule component expects the availability array to be a 7-element array where each element is an array of time ranges. The previous structure didn't match this expectation. Now each day has its proper array structure, even for days with no availability (empty arrays).

